    "response_text": "Finch & Fork is a highly-rated restaurant located at 31 W Carrillo St, Santa Barbara, CA. It offers a variety of cuisines including Breakfast & Brunch, American (New), and Traditional American. The restaurant operates from Monday to Saturday from 17:00-21:00 and on Sunday from 9:00-14:00. The establishment offers a variety of amenities including free WiFi, garage and street parking, valet service, and take-out options. It also caters to groups and accepts reservations. However, it does not offer outdoor seating or live music. The ambiance is described as classy. Finch & Fork has garnered a 4.0-star rating, with customers praising its brunch menu, quality of food, and excellent service. Patrons particularly appreciate the \"mimosa madness\" and the restaurant's breakfast offerings. However, some customers feel the food is overpriced.",
